Applysmith
========

This product includes third-party software and assets. This file lists every
third-party asset that is committed to the repository or shipped in the
packaged app. Go modules and dashboard packages that are linked into the
shipped app are listed with versions and SPDX licence identifiers in
third_party/NOTICE-dependencies.txt, which is generated by "make notices".
Licence texts are kept under third_party/licenses/.

