Linked into PersonalCU.app
--------------------------

"make computer-use" builds computeruse/ into its own app, PersonalCU.app. SwiftPM
fetches these packages at the revisions pinned in computeruse/Package.resolved
and links them into that app; none is committed. Licence texts:
third_party/licenses/Apache-2.0.txt and third_party/licenses/MIT-computeruse.txt;
each package's own LICENSE (and NOTICE, where it has one) is in its checkout
under computeruse/.build/checkouts/.

